 "Falsch. Heiligabend … welcher Tag ist das?": "assets/voices/mira/47d7828ee7.mp3",
 "Falsch. Vier Ziffern …": "assets/voices/mira/f2ca61a714.mp3",
 "Du musst raten! Zeig drauf!": "assets/voices/mira/ccb01cf071.mp3",
 "Hallo. Ich bin Mira. Ich bin sieben.": "assets/voices/mira/12e5205be1.mp3",
 "Schon ganz lange.": "assets/voices/mira/b593a9cfb3.mp3",
 "Ja! Ich sehe was, was du nicht siehst …": "assets/voices/mira/a4c3d3d563.mp3",
